# Empty Shelf Reference Images
#
# Place empty shelf photos here for multi-reference comparison.
# Naming convention:  empty_001.png, empty_002.png, ...
#
# Tips:
#   - Capture under different lighting (morning, afternoon, evening)
#   - All images must be the same resolution as the current camera feed
#   - The system auto-discovers files matching: empty_*.png
#   - More references = more robust detection (3-5 is a good target)
